---
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Bottom from "../components/bottom-logo2.astro";

import "../assets/styles/fonts.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-br">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
        <link rel="canonical" href="https://turinflow.com.br/precos" />
        <meta
            name="description"
            content="Tabela de Preços para os Planos Turin. Entenda o que podemos oferecer por você."
        />
        <title>Preços do Turin</title>

        <style>
            *,
            *::before,
            *::after {
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            :root {
                --brand-main: #ffd700;
                --brand-dark: #333;
                --bg-light: #f9f9f9;
                --light-2: #eee;
                --mid-color1: #bec1b9;
                --mid-color: #131b21;
                --darker-1: #474646;
            }

            body {
                background: linear-gradient(
                    0deg,
                    #eee 0%,
                    #e4e4e4 65%,
                    #555 100%
                );
            }

            .row {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .frosted-glass {
                border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
                padding: 1rem;
                box-shadow:
                    inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05),
                    0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);

                background-color: rgba(130, 150, 160, 0.8);
                backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(150%);
                width: 90vw;
                margin-top: 0.3rem;
                margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
            }

            .widgets2 {
                width: 90vw;
            }

            .border-radius1,
            .border-radius2,
            .border-radius {
                border-radius: 18px 18px 18px 18px;
            }

            .mobile-text {
                text-align: center;
            }

            @media (min-width: 768px) {
                .border-radius1 {
                    border-radius: 96px 18px 18px 18px;
                }

                .border-radius2 {
                    border-radius: 18px 18px 96px 18px;
                }
            }

            @media (min-width: 900px) {
                .row {
                    flex-direction: row;
                }

                .widgets2 {
                    width: calc(50% - 7.5px);
                    padding: 4rem;
                }
            }
        </style>
    </head>

    <script
        src="https://sp.turinflow.com.br/api/script.js"
        data-site-id="3a248a45ee62"
        defer
    ></script>
    <body>
        <Header />
        <div>
            <div
                class="s1"
                style="width: 85vw; padding-top: 4rem; font-size: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); line-height: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); margin-inline: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #eee;"
            >
                PREÇOS
            </div>
            <div
                class="g2"
                style="letter-spacing: 1px;font-weight: 500; width: 85vw; padding-bottom: 4rem; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; color: #eee; margin-inline: auto;"
            >
                Aqui, divulgaremos os preços dos diferentes planos Turin. Pague
                mensalmente ou anualmente. Escolha o jeito que você preferir.
            </div>
            .
        </div>

        <div style="width: 90vw; margin-inline: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px 15px; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
            <div
                class="row"
                style="display: flex; width: 90vw; height: auto; justify-content: space-between; row-gap: 15px; column-gap: 15px;"
            >
                <div
                    class="frosted-glass border-radius1 widgets2"
                    style="background-color: rgba(50, 50, 200, 0.35); border: 2px #999 solid"
                >
                    <div
                        class="s1"
                        style="padding-top: 4rem; font-size: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); line-height: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center;"
                    >
                        TURIN ESSENTIALS
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="g2"
                        style="font-weight: 500; padding-bottom: 8rem; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; text-align: center;"
                    >
                        <a
                            style="text-decoration-line: #eee; color: #ddd;"
                            href="/rotinas"
                        >
                            {" "}
                            Coordene sua vida inteira
                        </a>
                        .
                        <div
                            class="g2"
                            style="font-weight: 500; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; text-align: center; padding-top: 4px;"
                        >
                            R$ 39
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div
                    class="frosted-glass border-radius widgets2"
                    style="border: 2px #999 solid"
                >
                    <div
                        class="s1"
                        style="padding-top: 4rem; font-size: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); line-height: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center;"
                    >
                        TURIN PILOTO
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="g2"
                        style="font-weight: 500; padding-bottom: 8rem; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; text-align: center;"
                    >
                        <a
                            style="text-decoration-line: #eee; color: #ddd; padding-bottom: 3rem;"
                            href="/rotinas"
                        >
                            Comece a explorar
                        </a>
                        .
                        <div
                            class="g2"
                            style="font-weight: 500; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; color: #eee; margin-inline: auto; text-align: center; padding-top: 4px;"
                        >
                            Sem custo para você.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div
                class="frosted-glass border-radius2"
                style="background-color: rgba(240, 245, 240, 0.5); width: 90vw; margin-inline: auto; border: 1px #ccc solid"
            >
                <div
                    class="g2 mobile-text"
                    style="font-weight: 600; width: 85vw; padding-top: 4rem; font-size: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); line-height: clamp(40px, calc(100vw * 0.069), 165px); margin-inline: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #888;"
                >
                    Ainda em dúvida?
                </div>
                <div
                    class="g2 mobile-text"
                    style="letter-spacing: 1px;font-weight: 500; width: 75vw; padding-bottom: 4rem; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; color: #888; margin-inline: auto;"
                >
                    Tente Turin Piloto. Simule a vida de alguém ou reorganize
                    sua vida inteira com Turin, sem incorrer nenhum custo.{" "}
                    <a
                        style="color: #888; text-decoration-line: #888"
                        href="/rotinas"
                    >
                        Comece aqui
                    </a>
                    .
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <Bottom />
    </body>
</html>
